WEBVTT

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:15.040
<i>DOKI - Chihiro</i>

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:15.040
<i>DOKI</i>

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:21.870
<b>fukigenna tenki moyou ga nori utsutteta aitsu</b>

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:21.870
<b>不機嫌な天気模様が乗り移ってたアイツ</b>

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:21.870
<b>That fellow was affected by bad weather</b>

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:28.040
<b>nanda! chotto naname ni sora wo miteta dake ka</b>

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:28.040
<b>なんだ！　ちょっとナナメに空を見てただけか</b>

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:28.040
<b>What! He's only squinting at the sky</b>

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.630
<b>shiritai (misetai)</b>

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.630
<b>知りたい（見せたい）</b>

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.630
<b>I want to know (I want to see)</b>

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:31.210
<b>wakaritai (wakaranai)</b>

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:31.210
<b>解りたい（解らない）</b>

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:31.210
<b>I want to understand (I can't understand)</b>

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.800
<b>nakitai (nakenai)</b>

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.800
<b>泣きたい（泣けない）</b>

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.800
<b>I want to cry (I can't cry)</b>

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.380
<b>soredemo</b>

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.380
<b>それでも</b>

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.380
<b>Even so,</b>

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.970
<b>shikatanai (kubomanai)</b>

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.970
<b>仕方ない（凹まない）</b>

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.970
<b>It can't be helped (Not feeling depressed)</b>

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.600
<b>itakunai (youkumonai)</b>

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.600
<b>痛くない（痒くもない）</b>

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.600
<b>It doesn't hurt (It doesn't itch)</b>

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.970
<b>kowashitai (kowaretai)</b>

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.970
<b>壊したい（壊れたい）</b>

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.970
<b>I want to break (I want to be broken)</b>

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.640
<b>yuzurenai omoi nara</b>

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.640
<b>譲れない思いなら</b>

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.640
<b>I don't want to surrender these feelings</b>

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.400
<b>chiratsuku kiiro shingou mushishite</b>

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.400
<b>ちらつく黄色信号　無視して</b>

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:48.400
<b>Just ignore that flashing yellow signal</b>

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:54.030
<b>kou kakudo de joushou chuu kokoro no flying saucer</b>

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:54.030
<b>高角度で上昇中　心のflying saucer</b>

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:54.030
<b>The flying saucer in my heart is rising at a sharp angle</b>

00:00:54.030 --> 00:01:00.870
<b>nakanaka sunao ni nan nai himitsu no tobira ni keri irete!</b>

00:00:54.030 --> 00:01:00.870
<b>なかなか素直になんない秘密のトビラに蹴り入れて！</b>

00:00:54.030 --> 00:01:00.870
<b>It kicks open that dishonest, secret door</b>

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.080
<b>chuugaeri de mata modotte kuru yo</b>

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.080
<b>宙返りでまた戻ってくるよ</b>

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.080
<b>Do a loop-the-loop and return once more {Loop-the-Loop is the title of this song}</b>

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:12.510
<b>sakaraenai jiryoku mitai na omoi yo todoke!</b>

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:12.510
<b>逆らえない磁力みたいな思いよ　届け！</b>

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:12.510
<b>Convey those seemingly irresistable magnetic feelings to you!</b>

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:20.180
<b>omote no kādo de shoubu shinai nande</b>

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:20.180
<b>表のカードで勝負しないなんで</b>

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:20.180
<b>You can't use a face card to decide the victory.</b>

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.060
<b>dare no tame no moraru?</b>

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.060
<b>誰のためのモラル？</b>

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.060
<b>Whose morals are those?</b>

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:36.990
Motto To LOVE-Ru 25

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:36.990
<u>For Whom the Bell Tolls</u>

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.660
Thanks, Celine.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:49.880
Hm? What's up?

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:52.460
I'm preparing for the Christmas party.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:53.670
Christmas?

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:56.880
Well...

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.840
[Sainan Shopping District]

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:03.390
It's so cold...

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:08.600
Hello, Yuuki-kun.

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:10.230
Sairenji!

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.860
Doing some Christmas shopping?

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:16.190
Uh, no... I'm looking for Yami, actually.

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:17.650
Yami-chan?

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:21.950
We're having a Christmas party today at home.

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:25.750
Mikan would be very pleased to have Yami over.

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:27.200
They really get along well.

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:29.790
So... If it's all right with you...

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:31.790
Would you like to come too, Sairenji?

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.670
Eh? Well...

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:35.840
I'm really sorry.

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:38.800
It's been a while since my parents have come home,

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.970
so I'll be spending some time with them today.

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:42.760
I see.

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.510
Can't really do anything about it, then.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:46.810
All right then, gotta go.

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:48.520
OK. See you.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:54.020
A party at Yuuki-kun's house...

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:56.190
I've wasted a good chance...

00:02:56.780 --> 00:02:59.570
But if it were just the two of us...

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:03.700
Sairenji...

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.370
What is it, Yuuki-kun?

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:08.620
I have a present for you.{http://i336.photobucket.com/albums/n354/dansone/funny%20shit/dick_box01.jpg -masat}

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:11.040
Y-Yuuki-kun...

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:19.260
I'm being absurd!

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:20.720
There's no way that would happen!

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.050
But it'd be wonderful if it did...

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:30.140
That Yami... she isn't at school...

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:33.230
She might be at the bookstore or the taiyaki shop...

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:34.560
I have to find her quickly!

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:38.230
That Rito... where'd he run off to?

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.440
Hey, Mikan.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:44.450
Did you have Christmas parties with Rito when you were younger?

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:48.370
This will be our first proper party.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:51.710
But we just ate cake by ourselves.

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.540
But there was this time...

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:58.090
when Rito worked very hard to set a Christmas tree up.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:02.550
I do wonder how long ago that happened...

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:04.550
All right, I'm done!

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:07.140
What a poorly done tree. {That's a sucky tree -anon1}

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:08.470
Shut up!

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:10.180
It's fine, isn't it?

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:14.650
Here, Mikan.

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:15.440
Eh?

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:21.110
Well, it's a present I just got from Santa.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:24.820
Yay!

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:29.620
But I'm aware that Santa doesn't exist, you know?

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:37.880
Did Onii-chan buy these for me?

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:38.920
Well... yeah...

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:42.130
Since you don't really like toys...

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.920
I had trouble thinking of what to buy.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:47.640
And you see, our parents are rarely home,

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:50.140
so I thought you were lonely.

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:52.270
That's why...{I got you a preset}

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.100
That's not true!{It's nothing like that!}

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:54.770
Eh?

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:58.190
Thanks, Onii-chan!

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:03.030
But someday, it'd be nice if we can have a Christmas party with lots of people...

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:04.900
Yeah.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:06.700
I see!

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:10.280
That's why you're working hard preparing for this Christmas party.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:11.160
Something like that.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:17.040
Even though Mum and Dad are too busy to come home, as usual.

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.880
But this year, we have you and the others.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.380
Mikan...

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:28.220
Coming to me by yourself... {Coming here by yourself? -anon1}

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:30.890
Does that mean you're finally prepared to die?

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.060
No, no!

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:33.680
Listen to me, Yami!

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:38.400
Christmas party?

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:42.190
I'm not really fond of noisy things.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:45.110
Don't say that! Please come!

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:46.360
Why should I?

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:48.820
I want Mikan to be happy.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.580
If you come, I am sure she'd be happy.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:01.380
I'm back!

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.460
Welcome home, Rito!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.050
The preparations are already done...

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.260
Eh?! Yami-san!

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:08.220
Good evening.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.640
I ran into her by chance...

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:12.680
I'm so happy!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:15.140
I was really wondering what you were up to!

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.020
So, come in, come in!

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.600
Mikan!

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.770
Lala-san?

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:23.190
The presents are ready!

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:26.070
Here you go!

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:29.110
Yo!

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:32.200
Dad... Mum too...

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.660
Why are the two of you here?

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:36.410
I'm a bit surprised too.

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:38.750
I was in France just a few moments ago...

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.500
I brought her home with my spaceship!

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:43.040
And I had a deadline to meet.

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:46.380
Zastin and the others said they'll take care of the rest!

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.340
Those guys have grown up!

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:50.840
We can spend this day together!

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:54.050
I haven't tasted Mikan's cooking for a long time!

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:57.470
Coming!

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:58.680
Who is it-

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:01.230
Sairenji.

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:02.610
Haruna!

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:04.110
Good evening!

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:09.570
I've talked it over my folks, and they've allowed me to come here.

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:10.740
If it's still OK with you...

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:12.490
Of course it is!

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:13.910
Come in, come in!

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.280
Welcome!

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:20.120
Ah! The more the merrier!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.580
Is there enough cake?

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:23.790
It'll be fine, it'll be fine!

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:27.760
Mikan, I'm sorry.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:31.340
I've caused you so much hardship, and made you feel lonely.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.760
Mum...

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.190
I see.

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:46.480
Lala-san and Rito... For my sake...

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:48.900
Thank you!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.900
All right, let the Christmas party begin!

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:01.830
Delicious!

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:06.040
So... Who's the mother of this child?

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:07.920
No!{You're wrong!}

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:18.890
Motto To LOVE-Ru 26

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:18.890
<u>The Troubling Rampage? {the what?} {and seems like the title is in question form}</u>

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.820
Panties! Panties! Panties!

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:31.530
Good morning, Rito-san!

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:33.030
Eh? Momo?!

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.530
You look lively today! How nice!

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:39.410
All right, I'm going to change!

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:47.040
Um... This...

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.260
Rito, you're the only one left...

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:53.420
Take your time!

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:55.840
I'm not going to wake you up again.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:59.970
Why were there panties inside my futon?

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:03.980
Also, there's the issue of why Momo was next to me when I woke up.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:08.020
To Rito!

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:10.360
I'm on duty today, so I'm leaving early!

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:13.530
Peke is still recharging so I left him behind.

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:15.150
Bring him with you once he's finished charging!

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:17.240
I'm counting on you! From Lala.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:19.030
Recharging...

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.660
When will he finish charging?

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:23.500
Hey, Peke! Wake up!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:26.290
No good, eh...

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.210
What's the matter, Rito-san?

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.040
Eh?

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:33.840
Um... Peke hasn't finished recharging.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.010
Peke-san?

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:38.090
At this rate, I'm gonna be late.

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:39.760
Can you do anything about it? {orig TL: Have you any ideas?}

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.970
Let's see if I can come up with something.

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.430
Is this a recharger?

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:48.100
It think it is...

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.560
All right, I'll give it a go.

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:50.560
Wait a sec!

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:52.150
I think we should test it first...

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.790
Rito and Peke aren't here yet.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.630
Onee-sama!

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:11.380
Ah! Momo!

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:16.050
Here. Rito told me to do him a favour and bring Peke-san to you!

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:18.800
Hello, Lala-sama.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.970
Thanks, Momo!

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:22.050
Thanks for your help! {TLC}

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.350
Don't mention it.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.390
What happened to me?!

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.730
Sorry, Rito-san!

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:32.560
This is a device that digitizes you into data to be sent.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:37.950
It's originally a device used to send things into game worlds.

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:43.370
It seems to have digitalized your body and sent you inside Peke's body.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.410
What should I do?!

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:48.040
Although changing back is easy...

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:50.540
It might take about two hours. {2 hours to transform? or 2 hours before he gets his body back?}

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:53.040
It's going to take that long?!

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:53.880
I know!

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:58.050
How about you pretend to be Peke for just today?

00:10:58.050 --> 00:10:59.010
Eh?

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:00.970
I'll help out too!

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:02.430
Okay?

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:04.470
Even though she said that... {TLC}

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:05.350
All right, Peke!

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:08.060
I'll leave the change of clothes up to you!

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:08.600
Eh?

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:10.980
How do I do it?

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:12.980
It'll be fine if it's you, Rito-san!

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.610
Why do you say that?! {TLC}

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:17.230
Hey, hurry up!

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:19.030
If it's come to this... {orig line: If it's like this...}

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:21.280
Form... change!

00:11:28.870 --> 00:11:30.710
Wrong, Peke!

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:32.370
I need my gym uniform!

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:33.830
Sorry!

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:37.090
Maybe this was a bad idea after all.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:43.760
Even though I've succeeded in form change... {TLC}

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.260
This feeling...

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:50.100
Every time she moves, the clothes rub against her...

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:53.810
I can feel her body warmth directly...

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:58.480
The shape of her body... is very clear to me!

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:02.570
What's wrong, Peke?

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:04.360
Nothing!

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:07.780
I wonder if Rito-san is doing fine...

00:12:07.780 --> 00:12:12.040
Hey Momo, why do I have to be Peke? {TLC}

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:13.830
I'm sorry.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:17.590
I don't want Onee-sama to know about my failure.

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:18.340
Eh?

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:21.380
This happened because I mistook the usage of an item...

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:24.590
that's why you're inside Peke's body.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:28.220
Onee-sama would definitely scold me.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:31.600
I don't think she would be that angry...

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:36.690
Come to think of it, it was me who used the item without finding out what it does.

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:37.810
But...

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:38.770
All right.

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:41.030
Don't worry. I'll do my best!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:43.610
Thank you, Rito-san!

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:46.990
Lala-san, they said we're doing the long jump today.

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.200
Yep!

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.200
Warm ups are finally over.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:53.750
Lala-san?!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.580
Geez... What's wrong, Peke?

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:58.210
S-Sorry! I'll recover it right away! {TLC}

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:02.090
Ah! It's too tight, Peke!

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:05.010
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:07.890
Even though it's not good, {TLC}

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:09.430
but Rito-san is inside Peke,

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:15.100
and when I think that Rito-san is wrapping tight around Onee-san's helpless body, it makes me... {any idea to make it shorter? -anon1} {or make the fonr smaller for this line}

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:19.770
What's wrong with Peke-chan?

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:22.400
Seems like he's not feeling well.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:28.370
This elasticity... and destructive power...!

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:30.370
This isn't good... my head is spinning.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:33.750
My body is flaming up!

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:38.040
Lala-san! Peke-chan is smoking!

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:38.880
Eh?

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:40.630
Eh?

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.260
Peke? Why did you suddenly-

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:54.730
What's going on?!

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:00.770
Peke!

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:03.280
Stabilize your form...

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:05.490
Even if you say that...

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:07.320
Lala-san! Are you all right?

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.130
How come they got changed too?

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.300
Don't tell me... because of Rito-san's existence...

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:26.260
Peke-san's system is going on a rampage?

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:30.680
Hey! Why are you wearing that in the middle of gym class?

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:44.520
How shameless!

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:54.330
Peke?

00:14:55.740 --> 00:15:01.080
Even I can't resist Lala sounding like that... it feels so good and it's making me dizzy...

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:10.220
Eh? Peke?

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.680
Onee-sama!

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:16.220
I entered the data of your gym clothes on the Peke badge you were using earlier.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.520
So use this for now.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:20.850
Momo?

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.400
Peke-san's condition seems quite bad,

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.940
so I'll give him some maintenance.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.480
See you!

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:37.540
Sorry, Rito-san.

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:42.330
Having you act as Peke-san was really troublesome for you.

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:47.420
But still, you stuck with it and didn't tell Onee-sama.

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:51.630
For my sake... You're a really nice person.

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:56.930
This is making me more and more attracted to you...

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:01.980
Peke!

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:04.690
You should say something if you are not feeling well!

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:06.520
Hah?

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:17.450
Motto To LOVE-Ru 27

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:17.450
<u>Loving Idol</u>

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:22.040
Rito-kun!

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:23.920
Run. What's up?

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.250
You suddenly called me out...

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.250
You see...

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.960
You want me to be your boyfriend for a day?

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:32.590
Why?

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:35.930
Yesterday at backstage, a friend and I were talking about love.

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:38.470
I lied and said that I had a boyfriend.

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:40.560
And since we both have the day off,

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:42.930
she said she wanted to meet you.

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:45.400
Even so, why did you pick me out of all people?

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.900
Don't you want to?

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:50.900
It wouldn't hurt to be with me once in a while, right?

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:56.070
If you refuse, then I'll be seen as a girl who just wants attention.

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:01.370
She's here. Kyouko! Over here.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:03.250
Kyouko?

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:07.670
Hello. Nice to meet you.

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:09.380
I am Kirisaki Kyouko.

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:11.380
So you're Yuuki Rito-kun?

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:12.800
Yes!

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:15.010
Magical Girl Kyouko, in person!

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:18.220
Kyouko! This is my boyfriend Rito-kun.

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:21.970
So Run's friend is Magical Girl Kyouko.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:25.690
Oh yeah, they appeared together on the TV program.

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:29.150
Lately, they've been singing together too.

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:32.570
Now, shall we take a stroll?

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:33.360
Sure.

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:41.870
Is it all right for you two to come out in public like this?

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.580
Both of you are performers after all.

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:47.040
Kyouko says that if you act like you have nothing to hide,

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:48.460
people don't actually notice you.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:50.710
Ah! Don't get so close!

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:52.420
It's fine, right?

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:53.880
You two are so lovey-dovey!

00:17:54.710 --> 00:17:56.590
To protect my reputation, I lied to Kyouko,

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:59.550
and was unsure of what to do.

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:01.970
Then Rito-kun becomes my boyfriend for a day...

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:04.600
It actually turned out to be great!

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:08.230
Kirisaki-san is also an alien?

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.020
"Kyouko" is fine.

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:14.150
I'm actually half Flame-jin and half Earthling.{this was in a previous ep. Copy for consistency}

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:17.150
My ability to control fire is real.

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:20.160
Those weren't special effects?

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.740
What's wrong, Rito-kun?

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:27.790
If I were to tell Lala, she'd be so surprised.

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:32.670
Lala? Run's childhood princess friend, right?

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:34.050
Yeah, she's the one.

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:36.510
She's a huge fan of Magical Girl Kyouko.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:38.800
I'm so glad!

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:43.310
He looks so happy when he talks about Lala...

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:45.810
So Rito-kun does like Lala after all.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:48.180
In spite of that, I'm...

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:50.600
...still happy that he pretended to be my boyfriend. {TLC}

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:54.150
Eh? What's wrong?

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:55.900
Nope. Nothing.

00:18:56.820 --> 00:19:00.110
For some reason, I feel like an idiot.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:07.080
If that isn't Kyouko-chuan and Run-chan!

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.200
Headmaster!

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:09.000
The pervert from before!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:14.250
This is not a time to be wearing clothes!

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:17.210
Please sign my body!

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:18.420
Let's get away!

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:20.880
This way!

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:23.720
Run? What's that?

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:25.640
It's a Galaxian Pervert Repellent Bomb!

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:27.100
I'll use this...

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:34.310
Are you two all right?

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.780
What happened to your clothes?!

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:48.790
No way! I mistakenly took the Clothes Disintegration Bomb!

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:50.290
Why the hell do you have something like that?!

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:57.090
So this is where you are!

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:01.050
Please sign my body!

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:02.970
This is bad. Shield me!

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:13.690
I'll go and buy you two some clothes!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:16.110
You two hide there!

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:26.870
A guy saw me... completely naked...

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:29.660
I'm sorry, Kyouko.

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:34.920
Well... I don't really mind.

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:36.580
If it's him, I guess it's forgiveable.

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:37.380
Eh?

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:40.130
Rito-kun's so cute, right?

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:43.050
His face went so red.

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.180
Kyouko...

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.550
You have to treasure him.

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:49.930
He's kind and understanding.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:53.940
Um... Kyouko...

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:54.850
To be honest...

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:56.560
He's not your boyfriend, right?

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:58.570
You knew?

00:20:58.570 --> 00:20:59.980
I found out halfway through.

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:01.940
You two were too stiff.

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:03.700
I knew straight away.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.070
I'm sorry.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:07.780
But I'm relieved.

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:08.490
Eh?

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:13.370
Since I don't have a boyfriend either, if Run had one, then... {TLC}

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.620
That's why I'm relieved.{TLC}

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:16.960
Kyouko.

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:21.420
You like Rito-kun, right?

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:23.340
Yeah.

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:25.300
What do you like about him?

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:26.760
Well...

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:30.220
Tell me more about that guy.

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:33.730
Next time, I'll support your relationship all the way.

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:37.150
Of course, we'll keep this a secret from the manager.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:38.980
Kyouko...

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:39.940
Hey!

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:42.650
I managed to contact Lala and got her to come.

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:44.530
Peke can repair your clothes.

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:46.950
Wow! It's the real Kyouko-chan!

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:48.820
I'm so happy!

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:50.740
Please be my friend!

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:52.660
I really wanted to talk to you!

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:55.410
Can you please repair our clothes quickly?

00:21:58.080 --> 00:21:59.420
What's that?

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:00.880
Is it dead? {i don't want to treat him as a human being lol}

